# Cloudflare Pages: the page and its maths must never be served from a stale cache after a deploy, and the data
# files change every few minutes (GitHub Pages ignores this file; its own cache is 10 minutes)
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
/*.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/mood.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/data/*
  Cache-Control: no-store
